  body { color: #f5f5f7; }
  a { color: #4da3ff; }
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;1.4.1 republishes 1.4.0, whose release did not complete. It contains everything below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 dir="auto"&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean legal URLs and least-privilege Google scope by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5576750753" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/33" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/33/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/33"&gt;#33&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Site banner and puppy favicon; puppy menu bar icon by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5579017447" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/34" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/34/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/34"&gt;#34&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix manual merge veto; merge same-title copies by rule; fix model prompt by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5579525437" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/35" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/35/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/35"&gt;#35&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh website hero and TimeTug demo by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5579989883" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/36" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/36/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/36"&gt;#36&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calendar connectors Phase 3: optional write API, Google and EventKit writes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5561530199" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/32" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/32/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/32"&gt;#32&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hidden switch: Google sign-in via the default browser by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5586323324" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/37" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/37/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/37"&gt;#37&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calendar abstraction: close the EventKit gaps (conferences, reminders, recurrence, identity, attendees) and fix manual merge by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5586847356" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/38" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/38/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/38"&gt;#38&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the hidden-calendar checkbox clickable across its whole square by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5589130166" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/39" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/39/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/39"&gt;#39&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Microsoft (Outlook) calendar connector by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5594327128" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/40" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/40/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/40"&gt;#40&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
