&lt;li&gt;chore(deps): Bump actions/checkout from 4 to 7 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot"&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5596520663" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/41" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/41/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/41"&gt;#41&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publish the semantic code index from CI by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5604511428" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/43" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/43/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/43"&gt;#43&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AGENTS.md: using a Swift language server; ignore agent tool state by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5605474536" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/44" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/44/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/44"&gt;#44&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Index: stop skipping code as secret-looking; leave past-work plans out by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/darkarena1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/darkarena1"&gt;@darkarena1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5605586616" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/issues/45" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/darkarena1/timetug/pull/45/hovercard" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/pull/45"&gt;#45&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
